WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.927
Database design can be discussed at three levels The
conceptual level

00:00:05.954 --> 00:00:11.377
is the business view We identify major subjects and
high-level relationships without

00:00:11.391 --> 00:00:16.919
worrying about PostgreSQL syntax The logical level
turns that

00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:22.513
business view into a relational blueprint We decide
tables attributes primary

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:28.784
keys foreign keys cardinality optionality and
normalization The

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:34.524
physical level is the actual database implementation
Here we choose PostgreSQL

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.774
data types indexes storage decisions and deployment
details Keeping

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:44.603
these levels separate is helpful because business
meaning should not depend on

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:50.234
one technical implementation For example the logical
idea that an

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.247
appointment belongs to a patient remains valid even
if the physical indexing

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.707
strategy changes later
